<title>POLAND: Wolczanka sets dividend at PLN 0.7.</title>
<headline>Wolczanka sets dividend at PLN 0.7.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Annually</p>
<p>				Latest 1996	     Prior 1995</p>
<p> Amount (PLN)		    0.7			0.7</p>
<p> Pay				 July 4, Dec 5*</p>
<p> Record			    June 10</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of the Polish garment maker is Wolczanka SA.</p>
<p>* The company plans to pay 0.4 zloty on July 4 and 0.3 zloty on December 5. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
